 "applies_to": "Radwag MW-01-A and MW-01-A7 mass converters per the November 2021 Modbus manual.",
 "summary": "The MW-01-A mass converter serves Modbus RTU on RS-485 and Modbus TCP (and RTU over TCP) on Ethernet. Input registers return mass, tare, unit, status, thresholds and dosing/adjustment state; holding registers take zero, tare, dosing and calibration commands plus threshold writes. Floats here are low word first, unlike Radwag's PUE indicators.",
